     <P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt" align=center><A name=标题><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt">关于开展<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN>年中华经典诵写讲系列活动的通知</SPAN></B></A><SPAN style="mso-bookmark: 标题"></SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-SIZE: 22pt; FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt"><?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt" align=center><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋"><o:p><FONT size=5> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoDate style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt"><A name=Body></A><SPAN lang=zh-CN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-ansi-language: #0400; mso-fareast-language: #0400"><FONT size=5>全校师生：<o:p></o:p></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>为贯彻落实中央办公厅、国务院办公厅《关于实施中华优秀传统文化传承发展工程的意见》和全国教育大会精神，深入实施中华经典诵读工程，教育部、国家语言文字工作委员会将于<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>年举办中华经典诵写讲大赛系列活动。根据《教育部语言文字应用管理司关于举办</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>2019</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>年中华经典诵写讲大赛的通知》（教语用司函〔</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>2019</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>〕</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>16</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>号），</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>市语委、市教育局决定<SPAN lang=EN-US>2019</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>年继续在全市开展</FONT><SPAN style="mso-bidi-font-weight: bold"><FONT size=5>中华经典诗文</FONT></SPAN></SPAN><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">诵写讲系列</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt">活动，举办绍兴市</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">经典诵读和诗词讲解大赛，组织参加全国诗文创作大赛、“祖国印记”学生篆刻大赛。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>现结合我校实际，就有关事项通知如下：<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>一、经典诵读大赛<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">2019</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">年绍兴市经典诵读大赛分小学生、中学生、教师、社会人员四个组别。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>我校须推荐</FONT><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow"><FONT size=5>学生、教师各<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>个</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>作品参加市直选拔赛，</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>根据选拔赛结果，每个组别择优推荐<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>个节目参加全市决赛。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>作品须录制成<SPAN lang=EN-US>MP4</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>视频格式并刻录成光盘（一式两份），每张光盘标签注明“越城</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5><SPAN lang=zh-CN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ansi-language: #0400; mso-fareast-language: #0400">区+绍兴市第一中学</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">+</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>经典诵读大赛<SPAN lang=EN-US>+</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>中学生组</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>/</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>教师组</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>+</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>作品名称”。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32.15pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>二、诗词讲解大赛<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT size=5>    </FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>2019</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>年绍兴市诗词讲解大赛分为小学教师、初中教师、高中教师三个组别。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>我校须推荐<SPAN lang=EN-US style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow">1</SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow">个高中教师作品</SPAN></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt"><FONT size=5>参加市直选拔赛，根据选拔赛结果择优推荐<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>个节目参加全市决赛。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>作品须录制成<SPAN lang=EN-US>MP4</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>视频格式并刻录成光盘（一式两份），每张光盘标签注明“越城区</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>+</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>绍兴市第一中学</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>+</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>诗词讲解大赛</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>+</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>高中教师组</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>+</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>作者姓名”。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>经典诵读大赛和诗词讲解大赛的视频光盘须于<SPAN lang=EN-US style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow">5</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow"><FONT size=5>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>14</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>日</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>17:00</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>前</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>交至校团委。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>市语委办将在<SPAN lang=EN-US>5</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>月下旬组织专家评选出经典诵读大赛和诗词讲解大赛每个组别的一、二、三等奖，同时设优秀组织奖，学生组另设优秀指导教师奖。每组优胜的</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>3</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>个作品将代表绍兴市参加全省比赛。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>三、诗文创作大赛组织参赛工作<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></B></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>诗文创作大赛要求围绕五个主题进行创作。作文类参赛对象与组别为：小学生、初中生、高中生三个组；诗词类参赛对象不限。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=5><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">请</SPAN><SPAN lang=zh-CN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ansi-language: #0400; mso-fareast-language: #0400; mso-highlight: yellow">高一各班选送1个作品</SPAN><SPAN lang=zh-CN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ansi-language: #0400; mso-fareast-language: #0400">参赛，</SPAN></FONT><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>参照“诗文创作大赛方案”（见教育部通知附件<SPAN lang=EN-US>2</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>），于</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow"><FONT size=5>6</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="BACKGROUND: yellow; mso-highlight: yellow"><FONT size=5>月<SPAN lang=EN-US>1</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>日前</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>报名交至校团委（电子邮箱<A href="mailto:sxyz_tw@163.com">sxyz_tw@163.com</A>，邮件标题为【中华经典诗文创作+班级姓名】），由校团委统计后上传至“中华经典诵读工程官方网站”。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><FONT size=5><B><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312">四、“祖国印记”学生篆刻大赛组织参赛工作</SPAN></B><B style="mso-bidi-font-weight: normal"><SPAN lang=EN-US style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; COLOR: black; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></FONT></P>
