<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 黑体"><FONT size=5>五、技术平台<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
