<P class=MsoNormal style="LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 28pt; TEXT-INDENT: 32pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-layout-grid-align: none"><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 仿宋; mso-bidi-font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 仿宋_GB2312"><FONT size=5>每组设一等奖<SPAN lang=EN-US>20</SPAN></FONT><FONT size=5>个，二等奖</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>30</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>个，三等奖</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>100</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>个，优秀奖</FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT size=5>200</FONT></SPAN><FONT size=5>个。学生组别设指导教师奖若干。比赛同时设优秀组织奖。优秀获奖作品将结集出版。<SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></SPAN></P>
